A practical pilot could be AI-assisted customer support ticket handling. When a ticket arrives, the AI can classify it by issue type, summarize the customer's problem, identify relevant information from the knowledge base, and draft a response. A human reviews and approves the response before sending it.
We can measure the pilot against the current process using response time, resolution time, accuracy, and percentage of AI drafts requiring major edits. Start with a limited set of low-risk tickets, review the results weekly, and refine the prompts and knowledge base based on feedback. This gives us a manageable test with clear, measurable business impact.
